{"ref":"BDB, תֹּךְ²","hw":"תֹּךְ²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּךְ</span></big>  ii. <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹךְ</span> <strong>n.m. injury, oppression</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּךְ</span>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">מִרְמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:7\" href=\"/Psalms.10.7\">ψ 10:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:12\" href=\"/Psalms.55.12\">55:12</a> (so Gi; Baer <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹךְ</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹךְ</span>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">חָמָס</span> (gloss) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:14\" href=\"/Psalms.72.14\">72:14</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ תְּכָכִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.13\">Pr 29:13</a> <em>oppressor</em> (𝔙 <em>creditor;</em> cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אישׁ חמסים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:49\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.49\">2 S 22:49</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:2\" href=\"/Psalms.140.2\">ψ 140:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:5\" href=\"/Psalms.140.5\">5</a>).—i. <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹךְ</span> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, תָּ֫וֶךְ\" href=\"/BDB,_תָּ֫וֶךְ\", dir=\"rtl\">תָּוֶךְ</a>.","next":"BDB, תְּכָכִים","prev":"BDB, תכך"}